  "solution": {
    "text": "AANGE can be arranged in <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn></math> ways<br />Six gaps will be created, two can be selected in <math><mmultiscripts><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mmultiscripts></math> ways where two R’s can be arranged in one way<br />So, required number of ways<br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>900</mn></math>",
